<h2 style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:
10.0pt"><font face="Arial" size="2">CAPITAL : KAMPALA ( KLA ) </font></span></h2>
<h2 style="text-align:justify"><font face="Arial" size="2"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:
10.0pt">BUSINESS</span></font></h2>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align:justify">· PASSPORT SHOULD BE VALID FOR 
  6 MONTHS.<br>
  · VISA APPLICATION FORM DULY FILLED IN AND SIGNED. <br>
  <b> NOTE:</b> 2 FORMS ARE REQUIRED IN CASE OF PASSENGERS GOING BEYOND DUBAI 
  AND REQUIRING VISAS ON BOTH OUTBOUND & INBOUND SECTORS.<br>
  · COVERING LETTER STATING THE APPLICANT'S NAME, DESIGNATION, PURPOSE AND DURATION 
  OF STAY.<br>
  · INVITATION LETTER FROM THE BUSINESS COUNTERPART IN U.A.E.<br>
  · BANK STATEMENTS FOR THE LAST 6 MONTHS.<br>
  · I/TAX RETURNS FOR THE LAST 3 YEARS.<br>
  · CREDIT CARD COPIES ALONG WITH STATEMENTS. <br>
  <b> <br>
  NOTE:</b> IF AN APPLICANT IS NOT IN POSSESION OF ANY CREDIT CARD, IN THAT CASE 
  HE / SHE HAVE TO SHOW FIXED DEPOSITS WORTH OF RS.5 LAKHS MINIMUM.<br>
  · CONFIRMED AIR TICKETS MANDATORILY ON <b>'EMIRATES'</b><br>
  <b> NOTE:</b> FOR 4 DAYS' VISA APPLICATIONS, ENTRY & EXIT SECTORS MUST BE CONFIRMED. 
  <br>
  <br>
  <b> MEDICAL REQUIREMENT:</b> NIL <br>
  <br>
  <b> FEE:</b> RS.1, 251 /- FOR 4 DAYS VISA (INCLUDING THE DAY OF ARRIVAL AND 
  DEPARTURE) <br>
  RS.3, 082 /- FOR A VISIT VISA VALID FOR 60 DAYS (INCLUDING THE DAY OF ARRIVAL 
  AND DEPARTURE) <br>
  <br>
  <b> TIME TAKEN:</b> 4 - 5 WORKING DAYS. <br>
  <b> NOTE:</b> IN CASE OF A FIRST TIME TRAVELLER, ALL DOCUMENTS HAVE TO BE SUBMITTED 
  IN ORIGINALS; OTHERWISE THE APPLICANT CAN SUBMIT THE DOCUMENTS IN PHOTOCOPY. 
</p>
